<title>BENIN: Fire destroys containers at Benin port.</title>
<headline>Fire destroys containers at Benin port.</headline>
<dateline>COTONOU 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fire has destroyed nine containers full of farm inputs at the port of Cotonou in Benin, witnesses and officials said.</p>
<p>The cause of Monday's blaze was not immediately clear.</p>
<p>--Abidjan newsroom +225 21 90 90</p>
</text>
